{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Bb]Peace, [F]per[F7]fect [Bb]peace,
[Bb]in [Eb]this [Cm]dark [Am7]world [F7]of [Bbsus]sin?[Bb]
[Bb7]The [Eb]blood [Cdim]of[Bb]Je[F7]sus
[Bb]whis[Eb]pers [Bb]peace [F]wi[F7]th[Bb]in.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Bb]Peace, [F]perfect peace, [F7]by thronging [Bb]duties pressed?
[Bb]To [Eb]do [Cm]the [Am7]will of [F7]Jesus: [Bbsus]this [Bb]is rest.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Bb]Peace, perfect [F]peace, with [F7]loved ones [Bb]far away?
[Bb]In [Eb]Jesus' [Cm]keeping [Am7]we [F7]are [Bbsus]safe, [Bb]and they.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[Bb]Peace, [F]perfect peace, [F7]our future [Bb]all unknown?
[Bb]Jesus [Eb]we [Cm]know, [Am7]and He [F7]is [Bbsus]on [Bb]the throne.
{end_of_verse}
